SUMMARY:Media School Celebration of Commencement
DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate our Media School graduates at the winter
  commencement ceremony.  Doors open at 1:30 p.m.\, and the ceremony begin
 s at 2 p.m. We'll recognize each graduate in attendance by name and celeb
 rate together as they walk down the stage.  Please RSVP (https://mediasch
 ool.indiana.edu/alumni/forms/commencement-rsvp.html) prior to the event.
